  "a5.title": "Best Free News Sources<br/><em>in 2026 (No Paywall)</em>",
  "a5.lede": "Finding reliable, comprehensive news without hitting a paywall has become genuinely hard. Major newspapers lock almost everything behind subscriptions. Here are the best free alternatives in French and English, grouped by style.",
