  "a5.p1": "If you want to skip opinion and go straight to facts, wire services are the original source behind most of the world's media. What you read in a newspaper is usually their dispatch, rewritten.",
  "a5.callout.agencies": "Before it appears in your favourite newspaper, most major news passes through a wire service. Reading directly at source means bypassing the editorial filter entirely.",
  "a5.p.ap": "One of the most neutral and respected sources in the world. Their site and app are entirely free with zero paywalled content. They cover everything — international politics, tech, economics, culture — in a strictly factual style.",
